###Listar
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/cliente?page=1&limit=3&search=juan

###Registrar
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/cliente
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "nombre_completo":"Juan Perez",
    "nro_identificacion":"12345678",
    "fecha_nacimiento":"1990-05-15",
    "telefono":"555-1234",
    "correo":"juan.perez@example.com",
    "estado":true
}

###mostrar
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/cliente/1

###modificar
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/cliente/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "nombre_completo":"Juan Perez Actualizado",
    "nro_identificacion":"87654321",
    "fecha_nacimiento":"1990-05-15",
    "telefono":"555-9999",
    "correo":"juan.actualizado@example.com",
    "estado":true
}

###eliminar
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/cliente/1
